PROBENTIUM local Debian packaging draft
=======================================

This source package uses format 3.0 (quilt). An upstream source archive may
contain debian/: dpkg-source replaces that directory with the packaging archive
before applying debian/patches/series. Use an exact immutable source archive,
not a moving branch checkout, for a distributable source package.

The distribution variant changes dependency metadata only. It does not alter
application runtime source, evidence formats or the original wheel-approval
manifest contract. The upstream pyproject file outside the applied quilt patch
keeps its original exact dependencies. See docs/kali-packaging.md for actual
system package versions, tests and limitations.

Build tests create a temporary virtual environment with system-site packages
and no pip. The venv module is supplied by the Python standard-library package
required through python3-all. Only the newly built module directory is registered
in that temporary interpreter so isolated parser children can import it.
Nothing is installed into the host system or fetched by the build rules.

The public GitHub noreply identity in this UNRELEASED draft is not a working
maintainer mailbox. Replace it with a user-supplied monitored public address
before requesting distribution inclusion. No team affiliation, upload,
acceptance, independent security review or legal certification is claimed.
